      "cellIndex": 28,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "What is the value of $\\omega$ at the peak? No other than",
      "sourceSha256": "1eed2efdcb6a8c12f2d637bde0fb01c14e1e9494a06da61e7e55603f50aa983b",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
